1
00:00:00,117 --> 00:00:02,117
(Howard:)Boy, some of the physical comedy
with Jar Jar

2
00:00:02,286 --> 00:00:04,456
(Howard:)is a little tough to watch.

3
00:00:06,323 --> 00:00:09,493
(Leonard:)At least they toned him down
in the second one.

4
00:00:09,626 --> 00:00:11,836
(Penny:)Yeah, he is pretty stupid.

5
00:00:14,331 --> 00:00:17,241
(Raj:)Hey, we can say it. You can't.

6
00:00:19,469 --> 00:00:22,079
(Penny:)-Hey, guys.
-Happy Star Wars Day!

7
00:00:24,007 --> 00:00:25,547
A Death Star cake!

8
00:00:25,709 --> 00:00:27,249
(Amy:)Yeah, we were hoping
it might cheer you up.

9
00:00:27,411 --> 00:00:29,251
(Bernadette:)And even though it meant
we had to miss the movies,

10
00:00:29,413 --> 00:00:30,753
(Bernadette:)we could still be
part of the fun.

11
00:00:30,914 --> 00:00:32,894
(Howard:)Well, you didn't miss anything.
We just started over.

12
00:00:33,050 --> 00:00:34,760
(Bernadette:)Son of a bitch.

13
00:00:40,157 --> 00:00:42,607
I (ORCHESTRAL SCORE)

14
00:00:51,234 --> 00:00:52,574
(Sheldon:)You're back.

15
00:00:52,736 --> 00:00:54,716
(Arthur:)Yeah, apparently...

16
00:00:54,871 --> 00:00:57,441
(Arthur:)...I'm here whenever...
whenever you need me.

17
00:00:57,607 --> 00:00:59,387
(Sheldon:)That's nice.

18
00:01:00,610 --> 00:01:02,350
(Arthur:)Maybe for you.

19
00:01:04,748 --> 00:01:07,128
(Sheldon:)Why do I need you now?

20
00:01:07,284 --> 00:01:09,624
(Arthur:)Well, as near as I could tell,

21
00:01:09,786 --> 00:01:12,896
(Arthur:)you fell asleep watching Star Wars,

22
00:01:13,056 --> 00:01:16,626
and now you're dreaming
you're watching Star Wars.

23
00:01:16,793 --> 00:01:18,393
(Sheldon:)So?

24
00:01:19,229 --> 00:01:21,439
I mean, don't you see
a problem there?

25
00:01:21,598 --> 00:01:26,208
I mean, how you're spending
your limited time on earth?

26
00:01:27,971 --> 00:01:29,421
(Sheldon:)Not at all.

27
00:01:30,741 --> 00:01:33,051
OK, good luck to you.

